  "description": "High-performance, zero-allocation transport framework for real-time .NET applications.\n      Provides unified client and server APIs built on a Reactor architecture with support for\n      TCP, IPC (shared memory), Inproc, and UDP transports.\n      Designed for ultra-low-latency, event-driven messaging in trading systems, telemetry, simulation,\n      and distributed processing pipelines.",
